        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eugene E. Lindsey\n- Organizations: United States Naval Academy, United States Navy\n- Places: Sprague, Washington\n- Roles: observation squadron\n- Systems: USS Maryland, Colorado-class battleship\n\nFacts:\n- Eugene E. Lindsey was born in Sprague, Washington, on 2 July 1905.\n- Eugene E. Lindsey graduated from the United States Naval Academy in 1927.\n- Eugene E. Lindsey served with an observation squadron on the USS Maryland.\n- The USS Maryland was a Colorado-class battleship.\n- The USS Maryland was the third ship of the United States Navy to be named for the seventh state.",
